    "intro_html":  "\u003cp\u003eOne of only two turkey builds in this batch, and it earns the slot. It lands at {{cal}} calories with {{protein}} grams of protein, on a tortilla carrying 18 grams of fiber for about 5 grams of net carb. Lean ground turkey gets smoky heat from chipotle, body from roasted sweet potato and zucchini, and a creamy tang from Greek yogurt stirred right into the filling. If you have made our Ground Turkey Burrito Bowl, this is the wrapped version with a roasted-vegetable twist you cannot get in the bowl.\u003c/p\u003e",
